I don’t disagree with what @67329 said but my issue really starts when those cheaper products come at the cost of workers' rights back here in our country.

@67329: I hear you! Sometimes, the situation feels very complex though - especially when considering international regulations vary greatly depending on the region in question!

I guess everyone gets into this discussion thinking they're pointing fingers...when in reality; it's not fair or right for us to ignore the bigger picture at hand. No matter which

